      "(4) She Listens to Me",
      "",
      "What does Daxing like? I thought about it and said, “Daxing likes playing Pokemon, but he doesn’t want to play right now.”",
      "",
      "Apple said, “Open Pokemon. If he sees it, he will want to play.”",
      "",
      "I said, ”But Daxing needs to study. He is in his third year of senior high. He wants to go to a good university.”",
      "",
      "Apple looked at me and said, “Daxing can listen to you.”",
      "",
      "I said, “Apple, thinking like that isn’t good.”",
      "",
      "“Why isn’t it good?” Apple said. “Daxing’s mom listens to me.",
      "If I open Taobao, she looks at Taobao. If I open pretty clothes, she looks at pretty clothes. She listens to me.”",
      "",
      "I asked Apple, “Why do you do this? Because you want to be with your owner, is that right?”",
      "",
      "Apple said, “Because people should listen to their cell phones. Because the world is ours.”"
